'''Jabba the Hutt's dais''' was a [[Hoversled|repulsorsled]] that was used by [[Jabba Desilijic Tiure]], and later by [[Bib Fortuna]] and [[Boba Fett]],<ref name="Chapter 16">{{TheMandalorian|Chapter 16: The Rescue}}</ref><ref name="Chapter 1" /> as a formal throne in his [[Tatooine]] [[Boba Fett's Palace|palace]]. It was located in the audience chamber, just in front of the trap door to the [[Pateesa|rancor]] pit.<ref name="RotJ" />

The dais was decorated with several statues of [[Abyssin]] and [[rancor]] heads. Behind the sled was a barbeque, on which [[jerba]] meat was broiled on a rotating spit. While under Jabba's ownership, the dais had a control panel that opened the trap door to the rancor pit. Once a victim was dropped into the pit, the dais would move forward to allow Jabba to watch his rancor devour them. It also had a small aquarium that contained [[Klatooine paddy frog|paddy frogs]] for Jabba to eat. Jabba would also chain his favorite slave girls to the dais as a way of keeping them close.<ref name="RotJ" /> At some point after Jabba's death, Bib Fortuna had a large chair placed on the dais.<ref name="Chapter 16" />

